Source: user request2026-10-27: The game needs to be installable as a PWA on phones. Design and criteria: docs/pwa_design.md. Browser/worker evidence does not establish installation on physical Android/iPhone hardware. HostedHTTPS deployment remains future operational work.

28 October 2026 operator release correction: public gameplay is guest-only, public account sign-in/community secured UI/public PWA installation disabled; separate admin uses verified GitHub account sharpninja only and remains installable as a PWA. Latest scope and criterion-level cases: docs/admin_pwa_release.md. Historical evidence below does not prove this changed release. All changed/new criteria remain unsatisfied pending final validation/HV and hosted checks.
